## Interface: 16001
## Version: @project-version@
## Title: AKForeverTargeter
## Notes: Targets of interest: one row per mob your tracked quests are after, and the NPC to hand them back to. Click a row to target it, with a raid marker beside it; one key targets any of them in turn. Rows can be hidden or pushed down the list, and only the quests where you are standing are shown. A 3x3 marker menu opens on the key you bind to it.
